# Unity .gitattributes
# Normalize line endings; treat Unity YAML/text assets as text so diffs and merges work.

* text=auto

# Unity YAML assets are text.
# NOTE: `diff=unity` 只在本地配置了 [diff "unity"] 驱动时才生效；
# 未配置时会被 git 静默忽略（无副作用）。需要的话执行：
#   git config diff.unity.xfuncname '^[^# ].*$'
# 若还要用 UnityYAMLMerge 做二路合并，再加：
#   git config merge.unity.driver 'UnityYAMLMerge merge -p %O %B %A %A'
#   git config merge.unity.name 'Unity YAML merge'
# 并在 .gitattributes 中将对应行改为 text diff=unity merge=unity
*.meta   text diff=unity
*.unity  text diff=unity
*.prefab text diff=unity
*.asset  text diff=unity
*.mat    text diff=unity
*.anim   text diff=unity
*.controller text diff=unity
*.overrideController text diff=unity
*.physicMaterial2D text diff=unity
*.physicsMaterial2D text diff=unity
*.preset text diff=unity
*.scenetemplate text diff=unity
*.guiskin text diff=unity
*.mixer  text diff=unity
*.shadervariants text diff=unity

# 其余 Unity YAML 文本资产（同属可文本化、可合并的序列化格式，
# 现在未被任何规则覆盖，一旦引入就是嗅探状态）
*.asmref    text diff=unity
*.playable  text diff=unity
*.mask      text diff=unity
*.lighting  text diff=unity
*.signal    text diff=unity
*.terrainlayer text diff=unity
*.shadergraph    text diff=unity
*.shadersubgraph text diff=unity
*.vfx       text diff=unity
*.vfxblock  text diff=unity
*.vfxoperator text diff=unity

# C# / shader / config files
*.cs      text diff=csharp
*.shader  text
*.cginc   text
*.hlsl    text
*.compute text
*.json    text
*.inputactions text
*.xml     text
*.yml     text
*.yaml    text
*.asmdef  text
*.rsp     text
*.txt     text

# 文档 / 脚本 / UI Toolkit —— 这些在仓库里都是纯 UTF-8 文本。
# 显式声明以避免依赖 * text=auto 的内容嗅探（含被工具生成的图与页面）。
*.md      text
*.py      text
*.svg     text
*.drawio  text
*.html    text diff=html
*.uxml    text
*.uss     text
*.tss     text
*.props   text
*.targets text
*.gradle  text

# 大小写显式声明：gitattributes 的匹配是**大小写敏感**的，
# 仓库里真实存在 DOTween.XML / ExcelDataReader.xml 两种写法；
# 在 core.ignorecase=false 的 Linux/CI 上 *.xml 无法匹配 *.XML，故单独列出。
*.XML     text

# .gitattributes / .gitignore 自身（工作区可能被写成 CRLF）
.gitattributes text
.gitignore     text

